{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t入境處表示，皇崗口岸現時出境人流相當繁忙，呼籲出境旅客凌晨2時前盡量改用深圳灣口岸出境。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n特區政府早前與深圳市相關部門達成共識，深圳灣口岸旅客及客車清關服務，今晚會由原本午夜12時關閉，延長兩小時至凌晨2時，以分流深宵跨境人流及車流。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.768701+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T17:31:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:20.383639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:12.233544+00:00","content_hash":"c92fba4c29226796cd0a083d24ef190fa99db82c2f984127e10a2ca6e8713023","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}